  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "A solid Yochelcionella greenlandica internal-mould art study informed by MGUH 27016, at a nominal 1 mm height. It is not a hollow living shell; unseen surfaces, projection function, life posture and molluscan anatomy are not established.",
    "zh": "以 MGUH 27016 为启发、名义高度1毫米的 Yochelcionella greenlandica 实心内模美术研究。它不是中空活体外壳；未见表面、突出部功能、生活姿态与软体动物解剖均未获确证。"
  },
